@page "/donate"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Donate";
    ViewData["Page"] = "Donate";
}

<div class="page">

    <p class="crumb"><a asp-page="/Index">Home</a> / Donate</p>
    <h1>Donate</h1>

    <p class="body-copy">
        I believe in free and open exchange of information, and I want to keep my educational content free for
        everyone to access. I will never put ads on my site, and I don't want to put behind a paywall resources that
        should be available to everybody, regardless of their financial situation.
    </p>

    <p class="body-copy">
        That said, tutorials take time and hosting costs money. If you find what I make useful, and are both willing and able to donate to
        fund all of this, you can do so using the links below. Thank you for your support!
    </p>

    <div class="link-list">
        <a href="https://ko-fi.com/oliverbooth" class="tile tile--padded">
            <div class="tile-icon-box tile-icon-box--ko-fi"><i class="ti ti-coffee"></i></div>
            <div class="label">
                <p style="font-weight:500;font-size:14px;margin:0">Ko-fi</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:2px 0 0">One-off support</p>
            </div>
            <i class="ti ti-external-link tile-external-icon"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/oliverbooth" class="tile tile--padded">
            <div class="tile-icon-box tile-icon-box--bmac"><i class="ti ti-cup"></i></div>
            <div class="label">
                <p style="font-weight:500;font-size:14px;margin:0">Buy Me a Coffee</p>
                <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:2px 0 0">One-off support</p>
            </div>
            <i class="ti ti-external-link tile-external-icon"></i>
        </a>
    </div>

    <h2>Crypto</h2>
    <div class="stack-list">
        <div class="crypto-row">
            <span class="crypto-symbol"><i class="ti ti-coin-bitcoin-filled"></i> BTC</span>
            <span class="crypto-address">1LmXvavJr1omscfkXjp7A4VyNf3XhKP9JK</span>
            <i class="ti ti-copy copy-icon"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="crypto-row">
            <span class="crypto-symbol"><i class="ti ti-currency-ethereum"></i>ETH</span>
            <span class="crypto-address">0x972C6641e36e2736823A6B1e6BA4D2A814b69fD2</span>
            <i class="ti ti-copy copy-icon"></i>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
